      "text": [
        "2411 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : «مَنْ أَرَادَ أَنْ تُطْوَى لَهُ اَلْأَرْضُ فَلْيَتَّخِذِ اَلنُّقُدَ مِنَ اَلْعَصَا وَ اَلنُّقُدُ عَصَا لَوْزٍ مُرٍّ»."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2411 - Commander of the Faithful Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as) said:\n\"Whoever desires the earth to be folded for them (making travel easier), let them use al-nuqūd from the staff, and al-nuqūd is a staff made of bitter almond wood.\""
        ]
      }
